{#import-from-html}
# Import from HTML

A snippet of the kind you get when you *paste from a web page*.
Running it through `pandoc -f html` and `pandocToCarve`
produces `webpage.crv` beside this file.

{#a-list-and-a-link}
## A list and a link

- First point, with /emphasis/.
- Second point.

> A quote, with a [link](https://example.com).

|= Name |= Role |
| Ada | Author |
| Grace | Editor |
